   "text": "**F_ANCESTRAL_ATLAS** · fact\n\nAncestral Atlas (Parent PROOFER v18): 30 stitched reasoning graphs (.jsonl & .canvas, 337 nodes, 0 orphans) in graphs/ancestral_v18_atlas/ + 169 resolved calibration bets (Brier 0.1556) + 29 solved V3R1T4S problems (39 packages across 18/18 categories) + Terence Tao [M2026] merge",
