   "id": "Q_META",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Q_META** · question\n\nRoot Meta & Oracle Seed (v18): How do we combine Stage-0.5 Spec Forensics (Law M9), the Sub-Second Exact Oracle (K9), Nine Breakthrough Laws (M1-M9), and Code-First Evolution (H-EVO-01/02/06) to solve the new domain targets in this instance?",
