   "text": "**T_ORACLE_GATE** · tool\n\nStage I Sub-Second Exact Oracle Gate (< 5s deterministic verifier + 1 positive baseline test + 1 negative shuffled/corrupted test + Stage-0.5 Law M9 spec/metric check + X14 PDF-to-txt guard; mandatory before any search)",
